I'm najyzgis. I've also used "saizotermis" on irc.
I'm a nintadni. I'm going to start learning lojban sometime around May 2012 (engineering student in college, not much time to sink into lojban).

I'm from Pittsburgh, PA, USA.

The name comes from {narju} and {zgike}, and hopefully I made the name correctly to mean "orange music". I didn't use "najgi'e" because some places won't allow the single quotation mark character in names. It's inspired by Venetian Snares, who has sound-color synesthesia. He made an album that he thinks sounds "orange". I'm generally a fan of his music, obviously.

